  "body": "Imagine waking to sunlight streaming through walls of glass, opening the doors to the pool, and enjoying a home where entertaining feels effortless and everyday living comes naturally. Brand new and thoughtfully designed, this exceptional Glendowie residence combines timeless materials, generous proportions and a seamless connection between indoors and out, creating a home to be enjoyed for generations.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 440sqm of living on an 809sqm freehold site, with road frontage and all-day sun in a peaceful pocket of Glendowie, this is a home designed on a grand scale. Five bedrooms, three bathrooms plus a separate WC, three living areas, a generous mudroom, scullery, heated pool and triple garaging provide space and flexibility for every stage of life.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the expansive primary suite features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, creating a private retreat. A fifth bedroom with its own ensuite on the ground floor offers an ideal guest suite, work-from-home space or accommodation for extended family.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed open-plan kitchen, dining and living area designed for the way families live today. A second lounge upstairs and a separate media room downstairs provide space to spread out, relax or entertain. Walls of glass dissolve the boundary between indoors and out, opening to a backyard rarely found in modern homes. Raised ceilings, quality finishes and ducted heating and cooling add comfort and sophistication throughout.\r\n\r\nOutside, the heated swimming pool is complemented by an expansive flat lawn, creating a true family playground. Whether hosting summer gatherings, watching children play or simply enjoying the north-facing sun, this is a setting designed to be used and enjoyed year-round.\r\n\r\nPracticality has been considered at every turn. An oversized mudroom sits directly off the garage, ensuring muddy shoes, sandy gear and wet togs stay contained. The scullery, complete with a second dishwasher, wine fridge and floor-to-ceiling cabinetry, provides exceptional storage and entertaining flexibility.\r\n\r\nTriple-car garaging offers abundant room for vehicles, storage and recreational equipment, with EV charging provisions already in place. From the moment you arrive, the home's largely single-level connection from garaging through to the outdoor living and pool area creates an ease of living rarely found, even in homes of this calibre.\r\n\r\nZoned for the highly regarded Churchill Park School and Glendowie College, and just minutes from St Heliers Village, waterfront walkways and the beach, this location delivers as strongly on lifestyle as it does on convenience.\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Auction, Wednesday 18 November, 10am (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nBrand-new homes of this scale, quality and specification are rarely available in Glendowie. We invite you to experience it for yourself.",
